Introduce ComponentAccumulator-style cell reconstruction for ALLEGRO.
    
Introduce CreateCaloCellsConfig.py, which contains ComponentAccumulator-style
configuration functions for ALLEGRO cell reconstruction.  Update configuration
scripts for ALLEGRO_o1_v03 and ALLEGRO_o2_v01 to use these functions.

This is a start at factoring out common configuration code to reduce
duplication.
